sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Commander
    participant UI as React Dashboard
    participant API as Express Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Sim as Virtual Robot

    C->>UI: Enter X=5, Y=10 and click 'Move'
    UI->>UI: Client-side validation (0..20)

    UI->>API: POST /api/move {x:5, y:10} with Bearer JWT

    API->>API: authenticate — verify JWT signature, decode {sub, role}
    alt invalid token
        API-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
    else valid
        API->>API: requireOperator — role == operator
        alt role == viewer
            API-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
        else commander
            API->>API: isValidTarget(5, 10)
            alt invalid
                API->>DB: MissionLog.create(outcome=ERROR, detail="Invalid coordinates")
                API-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable Entity
            else valid
                API->>Sim: POST /api/move {x:5,y:10} (retried with backoff)
                alt robot 200
                    Sim-->>API: 200 OK
                    API->>DB: MissionLog.create(outcome=SUCCESS)
                    API-->>UI: 200 OK
                else robot 5xx or timeout after retries
                    API->>DB: MissionLog.create(outcome=ERROR, detail=err.message)
                    API-->>UI: 503 Service Unavailable
                end
            end
        end
    end